{"name":"Happy Camper","hex":"#6b8350","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"happy camper","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["One who is thoroughly content or satisfied.","Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see happy,‎ camper."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/happy_camper"}],"entries":[{"title":"Happy Camper (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Happy Camper is a Canadian crime comedy film, directed by Sylvain Roy and Guy A. Lepage and released in 2004. The film stars Lepage as Pierre-Louis, an investment banker who is forced into witness protection after witnessing a crime committed by Jackhammer, the leader of a local biker gang. Assigned to a rural trailer park with the new name Marcel Paquette, he has to fight to stay alive after the gang organizes a plan to find him and retaliate."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Happy_Camper_(film)","wikidata":"Q2935520"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"happy camper":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-happy_camper.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-happy_camper.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-happy_camper.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-happy_camper.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-happy_camper.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Happy Campers - geograph.org.uk - 439448","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Happy_Campers_-_geograph.org.uk_-_439448.jpg/500px-Happy_Campers_-_geograph.org.uk_-_439448.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Happy_Campers_-_geograph.org.uk_-_439448.jpg","share":0.325625},{"title":"Olea europaea 20110419